  "readmeFile": "PACKAGE_README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.10.0-alpha.44: eh estimate portfolio is much faster with unchanged estimates: checkpoint saves no longer re-enumerate the checkpoint, each project shares one bounded analysis-artifact cache across snapshots and areas, persisted artifact reads no longer hold locks, and area projections reuse content hashes. Checkpointed eh change portfolio and eh calendar runs keep a durable per-commit result cache (portfolio-result-cache/1.0.0), so moved windows and new commits analyze only new work with identical output and digests. Fix Unreal portfolio areas: areas owning .uasset/.umap packages but not the .uproject/.uplugin now carry ancestor descriptors as context-only files, and Unreal analyzer 0.1.1 values their packages without a second entry point; whole-snapshot and non-Unreal estimates are unchanged. The measurement fingerprint changes, so existing portfolios need --upgrade rebuild. seed-rules/0.4.0 priors are unchanged; estimates remain experimental and uncalibrated. Full notes: https://github.com/VictorZakharov/efforthours/blob/v0.10.0-alpha.44/CHANGELOG.md",
